              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "cōnventiō, cōnventiōnis — \"an agreement, a covenant; an assembly\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Cōnventiō inter eōs facta est. An agreement was made between them."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "cōnventiō, cōnventiōnis f., built on conveniō, to come together: convenit, it is agreed. English convention."
            }
